      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "As-cast equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr has 8–16% room-temperature tensile ductility.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6317005::chunk::001::introduction::42ad25eeb0"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr has a yield strength of 163–530 MPa at 1000 °C and strain rates of 10⁻⁴–10⁻² s⁻¹.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6317005::chunk::001::introduction::42ad25eeb0",
        "PMC7475834::chunk::001::introduction::97cd4ea6cb",
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Uncoated HfNbTaTiZr is prone to severe or rapid oxidation in air at 1000 °C.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6317005::chunk::001::introduction::42ad25eeb0",
        "PMC7475834::chunk::001::introduction::97cd4ea6cb"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Poor oxidation resistance is a major limitation on the high-temperature engineering use of refractory high-entropy alloys.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6317005::chunk::001::introduction::42ad25eeb0",
        "PMC7475834::chunk::001::introduction::97cd4ea6cb"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A 20–50 μm silicide-based coating can be deposited on HfNbTaTiZr by pack cementation.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed silicide coating will act as an oxygen-diffusion barrier.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will produce a thermally stable and adherent silicide scale at 1000 °C in air.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "During high-temperature exposure, the silicide layer will form a protective oxide scale.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective scale will inhibit oxygen penetration and oxide growth in the HfNbTaTiZr substrate.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Suppressing oxygen ingress will preserve the substrate bulk microstructure.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coated specimens will show markedly lower oxidation mass gain than uncoated specimens.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coated specimens will develop a thinner oxide scale than uncoated specimens.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will preserve the alloy's characteristic 8–16% room-temperature tensile ductility.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will preserve a high-temperature yield strength comparable to the stated uncoated range of 163–530 MPa.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
